# Software Factory SF-006: private configuration of one registered application.
#
# Copy to factory-data/apps/<app-id>/.env (mode 0600; factory-data/ is not in Git,
# and factory_read_file refuses .env files). Read by the host execution adapter
# only, as data: KEY=value lines, no quotes, no expansion, no commands.
#
# APP_REPO: absolute path of the application's Git worktree root on this host.
# It must be a separate repository, not the Software Factory checkout and not
# inside it. It is never sent to ChatGPT, OpenClaw or exported artifacts.
APP_REPO=/absolute/path/to/your/application
